WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 087. BUILD YOUR OWN MEDIA SYSTEM. Coordinate ideas, research, production, rights, versions, publishing, reuse and learning across channels.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
SEE THE SYSTEM. NAME WHAT IS ACTUALLY MOVING. Make the actors, inputs, dependencies, decisions and consequences visible.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
TEST THE CLAIM. CHANGE ONE CONDITION. Use the interactive version to see what changes, what holds and what remains unknown.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
KEEP THE EVIDENCE. SHOW THE SOURCE AND THE LIMIT. Preserve provenance, uncertainty, responsibility and the path to correction.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
MAKE THE DECISION. TURN THE MAP INTO AN ACTION. Choose the next responsible move without hiding the tradeoff or the accountable human.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. COORDINATE IDEAS, RESEARCH, PRODUCTION, RIGHTS, VERSIONS, PUBLISHING, REUSE AND LEARNING ACROSS CHANNELS.. Watch the distributable film. Then test the richer web version for yourself.

